# APP TASK — gates

1. Use one task artifact and one bounded file allowlist; no unrelated surface cleanup.
2. State contract impact and whether backend, frontend, wire and browser lanes are required or skipped with reasons.
3. Run targeted red → green checks for every touched surface; parent owns frontend/browser commands.
4. Finish with evidence and a follow-up APP PLAN when the change is a new vertical slice.
